=== SURVEY ===
ADR-008 (OIDC Auth-Code+PKCE via ASWebAuthenticationSession; Keychain; biometric LAContext;
centralized 401 refresh), ADR-004 (KMP core owns auth, Apple wraps in a Swift facade),
ADR-009 (SSE reconnect must re-auth), ADR-011/014/015/016 (no-stub DoD, i18n, a11y,
