=== FACADE / SSE WIRING (what is wired vs deferred) ===
WIRED + host-typechecked: AuthCoordinator implements the AuthTokenProviding +
AuthChallengeHandling seams; RootView mounts the gate and owns the coordinator; AppContainer
gains connectAuth(_:). DEFERRED (with the rest of the KMP-networking facade, which has no
bootstrap on this host): the literal hand-off of the provider to the KMP ApiHttpClient
Authorization header / onUnauthorized and the SSE LiveConnection re-auth — these attach in
the future AppContainer.bootstrap(baseURL:) on the macOS build. No KMP symbol names were
fabricated. (Covenant 1/9: stated, not green-washed.)

